# Byte-for-byte preservation is mandatory: any CRLF/LF conversion would break SHA256SUMS.
# This file MUST NOT be copied from the application repository, which uses
# "* text=auto eol=lf" and would rewrite .tsv line endings on Windows checkout.
* -text
*.gz   binary
*.tsv  -text
*.json -text
*.md   -text
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
